flowchart LR
  P[Problem] --> H1[H1]
  P --> H2[H2]
  P --> Hd[H-deception]
  E1[E1] -->|C/I/N/?| H1
  E1 -->|C/I/N/?| H2
  E1 -->|C/I/N/?| Hd
  E2[E2] -->|C/I/N/?| H1
  E2 -->|C/I/N/?| H2
  E2 -->|C/I/N/?| Hd
  H1 --> Rank[Least-refuted ranking]
  H2 --> Rank
  Hd --> Rank
  Rank --> Report[Odds + rejects + milestones]
